{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55617","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 十五 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尘网休重织是非，冥心何不合玄微。\n庄周梦里多迷旨，惠子渔中少见机。\n拶路古松和冻折，盘空枯叶带霜飞。\n一言可达知音者，还得从吾此路归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55617.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55617","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}